      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC6908586::chunk::001::introduction::7b08936e5e"
      ],
      "same_system": "unclear"
    },
    {
      "text": "Increasing chromium content promotes formation of a more protective surface film and improves corrosion resistance.",
      "field": "hypothesis",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC6908586::chunk::001::introduction::7b08936e5e",
        "PMC10142552::chunk::000::abstract::d0fb87d7d2"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "Increasing nickel content promotes formation of a more protective passive film and improves corrosion resistance.",
      "field": "hypothesis",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Tailored heat treatments promote an optimized Cr/Ni-rich oxide-layer structure.",
      "field": "hypothesis",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "A compact protective oxide layer acts as a barrier to further oxidation or corrosion.",
      "field": "hypothesis",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "entailed",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC6908586::chunk::001::introduction::7b08936e5e"
      ],
      "same_system": "unclear"
    },
    {
      "text": "A conventional 316H-type stainless steel with standard heat treatment exhibits normal baseline corrosion behavior under aggressive conditions.",
      "field": "material_initial_state",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "A finely tailored Cr/Ni-enriched passive film minimizes ion diffusion.",
      "field": "structural_mediator",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC6908586::chunk::001::introduction::7b08936e5e"
      ],
      "same_system": "unclear"
    },
    {
      "text": "A finely tailored Cr/Ni-enriched passive film inhibits selective dissolution of less-noble elements.",
      "field": "structural_mediator",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC6908586::chunk::001::introduction::7b08936e5e"
      ],
      "same_system": "unclear"
    },
    {
      "text": "Chromium-containing alloys can form compact, self-healing chromia layers.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "entailed",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC6908586::chunk::001::introduction::7b08936e5e"
      ],
      "same_system": "unclear"
    },
    {
      "text": "The engineered passive film reduces diffusion of oxygen and aggressive species into the bulk material.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC6908586::chunk::001::introduction::7b08936e5e"
      ],
      "same_system": "unclear"
    },
    {
      "text": "The engineered passive film prevents dissolution of key alloying elements.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC6908586::chunk::001::introduction::7b08936e5e"
      ],
      "same_system": "unclear"
    },
    {
      "text": "The baseline steel forms a less-protective oxide layer and consequently has a higher corrosion rate.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
